{"seq":2,"slug":"index-vs-query-analyzer","title":"索引时与查询时分析器一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multilingual-search-analyzer-tokenization/analyzer-fundamentals/index-vs-query-analyzer","wordCount":1780,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"索引时与查询时分析器一致性\">索引时与查询时分析器一致性</h1><p>线上最常见的搜索故障形态不是报错，而是「功能正常但搜不到」。用户输入一个商品标题里明明存在的词，返回零结果或结果毫不相关，日志里没有任何异常，QPS 和延迟都正常。这类故障的绝大多数成因是同一个：索引时用的分析链和查询时用的分析链产出了无法对齐的词项。这个问题的可怕之处在于它是<strong>配置期的错误、运行期的沉默</strong>——配置写入的那一刻没有任何校验会拦你，错误要到真实查询打到这个字段上才显形。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两条链路的分工\">核心概念：两条链路的分工</h2><p>Elasticsearch 的字段 mapping 用 <code>analyzer</code> 和 <code>search_analyzer</code> 两个参数区分索引时与查询时的分析链。官方文档的说明是：<code>analyzer</code> 设置字段被索引时使用的分析器，若未单独配置查询分析器，它也用于查询时；<code>search_analyzer</code> 只在查询该字段时使用，且文档明确要求「如果提供了查询分析器，索引分析器必须通过 <code>analyzer</code> 参数同时指定」（<a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/specify-analyzer.html\">Elasticsearch specify-analyzer</a>）。</p>\n<p>查询时的分析器选择有一条优先级链，理解它才能判断「我的查询到底走了哪个分析器」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>全文查询内部的 <code>analyzer</code></td>\n<td>查询体里显式指定的分析器，优先级最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>字段上的 <code>search_analyzer</code></td>\n<td>mapping 里为查询时单独配置的链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td><code>analysis.analyzer.default_search</code></td>\n<td>索引级的默认查询分析器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>字段上的 <code>analyzer</code></td>\n<td>回落到索引时的链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td><code>standard</code></td>\n<td>最终兜底</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>索引时只有两级：字段的 <code>analyzer</code>，然后是 <code>analysis.analyzer.default</code>，最后兜底也是 <code>standard</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"词项对齐的可验证定义\">词项对齐的可验证定义</h2><p>「对齐」这个词需要一个可操作的定义，否则它只是口号。定义如下：对任意一段文本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，如果查询分析器产出的词项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_q(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与索引分析器产出的词项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊆</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_q(s) \\subseteq T_i(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，则称两条链在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 上<strong>查询侧对齐</strong>。</p>\n<p>选择子集关系而不是相等关系，是因为工程上更宽松的对齐往往就够用：索引侧可以产出更丰富的词项（例如索引时展开同义词），只要查询侧的词项都能在索引里找到即可。反过来则是致命的——查询侧产出了一个索引侧永远不会产出的词项，这个查询词就永久无法命中。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;原文 s&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;索引分析链 Ti&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;查询分析链 Tq&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;索引词项集&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;查询词项集&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F{&quot;Tq ⊆ Ti ?&quot;}&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[&quot;查询可命中&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[&quot;静默零结果&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"原文 s\"] --&gt; B[\"索引分析链 Ti\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"查询分析链 Tq\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"索引词项集\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"查询词项集\"]\n    D --&gt; F{\"Tq ⊆ Ti ?\"}\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt;|是| G[\"查询可命中\"]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[\"静默零结果\"]</pre><h2 id=\"什么时候必须用不同的查询分析器\">什么时候必须用不同的查询分析器</h2><p>既然不一致是事故源，为什么不强制两条链完全相同？因为有三类需求在物理上要求两侧不同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"搜索时同义词\">搜索时同义词</h3><p>同义词在索引时展开会让索引体积随同义词组大小线性膨胀，而且每次改同义词都要重建索引。所以主流做法是把同义词放在<strong>查询时</strong>展开：索引存原词，查询时把用户输入扩展成多个词项。这要求查询分析链比索引链多一个同义词过滤器，两条链必然不同。官方文档对 <code>synonym_graph</code> 的定位就是「只用于查询分析器」，并指出索引时同义词应该用标准的 <code>synonym</code> 过滤器（<a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/analysis-synonym-graph-tokenfilter.html\">Elasticsearch synonym_graph</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"停用词与短语查询\">停用词与短语查询</h3><p>停用词在索引时被移除会带来一个经典问题：文档里的 <code>the quick fox</code> 索引成 <code>quick</code>(0) <code>fox</code>(1)；用户搜短语 <code>&quot;the quick fox&quot;</code>，如果查询时也移除停用词，查询变成 <code>quick</code>(0) <code>fox</code>(1)，能命中；但用户搜 <code>&quot;quick the fox&quot;</code>——语义上不含这个词组的文档会被误命中，因为停用词的位置信息已经丢失了。</p>\n<p>解决方式是给短语查询单独一条链：<code>search_quote_analyzer</code> 为被引号包裹的短语查询提供分析器，典型配置是「普通查询链不放停用词过滤器、短语查询链放」，或者反过来用 <code>stop</code> 过滤器的 <code>remove_trailing</code> 控制尾部停用词的行为（<a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/analysis-stop-tokenfilter.html\">Elasticsearch stop tokenfilter</a>）。这条链与索引链的关系必须在设计阶段想清楚。</p>\n<h3 id=\"索引侧的领域扩展\">索引侧的领域扩展</h3><p>品牌、型号、类目这些领域词汇在索引时可能需要额外处理，比如把商品标题里的 <code>iPhone 15 Pro</code> 补一个不带空格的 <code>iphone15pro</code> 变体。这属于索引侧单向的增强，查询侧不需要镜像它，只要查询侧的通用归一化（空格移除）与它重合即可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个可落地的对齐配置\">一个可落地的对齐配置</h2><p>下面是一份德国站商品标题的完整 mapping，演示了索引链、查询链与短语查询链三者的分工。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;settings&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;analysis&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;filter&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;de_stem&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stemmer&quot;, &quot;language&quot;: &quot;light_german&quot; },&#10;        &quot;syn_de&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;synonym_graph&quot;,&#10;          &quot;synonyms&quot;: [&quot;kopfhörer, headphones, headset&quot;],&#10;          &quot;updateable&quot;: true&#10;        }&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;analyzer&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;title_de_index&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;custom&quot;,&#10;          &quot;tokenizer&quot;: &quot;standard&quot;,&#10;          &quot;filter&quot;: [&quot;lowercase&quot;, &quot;german_normalization&quot;, &quot;de_stem&quot;]&#10;        },&#10;        &quot;title_de_search&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;custom&quot;,&#10;          &quot;tokenizer&quot;: &quot;standard&quot;,&#10;          &quot;filter&quot;: [&quot;lowercase&quot;, &quot;german_normalization&quot;, &quot;syn_de&quot;, &quot;de_stem&quot;]&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;mappings&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;properties&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;title_de&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;type&quot;: &quot;text&quot;,&#10;        &quot;analyzer&quot;: &quot;title_de_index&quot;,&#10;        &quot;search_analyzer&quot;: &quot;title_de_search&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"settings\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"analysis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"filter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"de_stem\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"stemmer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"language\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"light_german\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"syn_de\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"synonym_graph\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"synonyms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"kopfhörer, headphones, headset\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"updateable\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"analyzer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"title_de_index\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"custom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"tokenizer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"standard\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"filter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lowercase\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"german_normalization\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"de_stem\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"title_de_search\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"custom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"tokenizer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"standard\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"filter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lowercase\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"german_normalization\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"syn_de\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"de_stem\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"mappings\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"properties\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"title_de\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"analyzer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"title_de_index\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"search_analyzer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"title_de_search\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这份配置满足对齐条件：查询链比索引链多的只有 <code>syn_de</code>，而 <code>syn_de</code> 的每条规则在查询侧展开出的词项要么是索引里存在的原词（因为规则右端也会被同一链的 <code>de_stem</code> 处理），要么是另一个索引里存在的词。<code>updateable: true</code> 让同义词文件可以在不重启节点的情况下重载，官方文档说明这一选项「只应该用于查询分析器」，重载通过 <code>POST /{index}/_reload_search_analyzers</code> 完成，并且「重载搜索分析器后应该清理请求缓存」（<a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/indices-reload-analyzers.html\">Elasticsearch reload search analyzers</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"验证对齐的两个手段\">验证对齐的两个手段</h2><p>配置写完不能靠人工审读，必须跑验证。第一个手段是 <code>_analyze</code> 的 <code>explain</code>，把同一段文本分别喂给两个 analyzer，逐级比对 <code>tokens</code> 数组——任何一级的分歧都可能是对齐破裂的位置（<a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/indices-analyze.html\">Elasticsearch analyze API</a>）。</p>\n<p>第二个手段是集成测试式的「反向查询验证」：从真实文档里抽样一段标题，用索引链分析得到词项集合，再对每个词项构造一个查询，断言该文档能被查回。这个测试的价值在于它覆盖的是端到端行为而不是配置文本，一次分析器改动后运行它，能捕获 <code>_analyze</code> 比对漏掉的图结构类问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"POST /products/_analyze?filter_path=detail.tokenfilters.tokens.token&#10;{ &quot;field&quot;: &quot;title_de&quot;, &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Bluetooth Kopfhörer&quot;, &quot;explain&quot;: true }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">POST /products/_analyze?filter_path=detail.tokenfilters.tokens.token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"field\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"title_de\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bluetooth Kopfhörer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"explain\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>同一条命令把 <code>title_de</code> 换成带 <code>search_analyzer</code> 的查询路径（在 <code>_analyze</code> 里显式传 <code>analyzer: title_de_search</code>），两次响应的 token 文本集合做差集，差集里只应出现「索引侧多出」的词项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>索引时与查询时是两条可独立配置的分析链，<code>search_analyzer</code> 只在查询时生效，且必须先有 <code>analyzer</code>。</li>\n<li>查询分析器有五级回退链，索引分析器只有三级，判断实际生效的分析器要看完整优先级。</li>\n<li>对齐的可操作定义是查询侧词项集合 ⊆ 索引侧词项集合；反过来必然造成静默的零结果。</li>\n<li>三类需求强制两侧不同：查询时同义词、短语查询的停用词处理、索引侧领域增强。</li>\n<li>验证对齐靠 <code>_analyze</code> 的 <code>explain</code> 逐级比对加上「反向查询验证」的端到端测试，二者互补。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对齐管的是「词项能不能对上」，还有一个更底层的问题：文本在变成词项之前，字符本身如何被归一——大小写、重音、全半角这些听起来相似的操作为什么必须分开处理，见 <a href=\"normalization-case-accent-width\">归一化：大小写/重音/全半角/Unicode</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"索引时与查询时分析器一致性","id":"索引时与查询时分析器一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两条链路的分工","id":"核心概念-两条链路的分工"},{"level":2,"text":"词项对齐的可验证定义","id":"词项对齐的可验证定义"},{"level":2,"text":"什么时候必须用不同的查询分析器","id":"什么时候必须用不同的查询分析器"},{"level":3,"text":"搜索时同义词","id":"搜索时同义词"},{"level":3,"text":"停用词与短语查询","id":"停用词与短语查询"},{"level":3,"text":"索引侧的领域扩展","id":"索引侧的领域扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"一个可落地的对齐配置","id":"一个可落地的对齐配置"},{"level":2,"text":"验证对齐的两个手段","id":"验证对齐的两个手段"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Tokenizer/TokenFilter 分析链组成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multilingual-search-analyzer-tokenization/analyzer-fundamentals/tokenizer-filter-chain"},"next":{"title":"归一化：大小写/重音/全半角/Unicode","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multilingual-search-analyzer-tokenization/analyzer-fundamentals/normalization-case-accent-width"}}